  "explanation": "Two ways for the hub to run workers elsewhere: [reach in over SSH](#over-ssh) or [ask a service on each machine](#machine-service). The difference to look at is what has to be running on a worker machine before any work starts. Leaves out the Ready check and what happens when a machine is offline, which work the same either way.",
